  "description": "In order to become a beast hunter, Jakyeong lives disguised as a man. Her life changes when she meets Giseok, lord of Suhara, and senses something sinister within him. She discovers he is half human, half beast—and that she alone can subdue him. Now that fate has drawn her to his side, what future awaits the two?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[R19](https://ridibooks.com/books/4800000345), [R15](https://ridibooks.com/books/4800000346)\n\n**Official English:**   \n[R19](https://manta.net/en/series/o-tree-of-many-years-full-ver?seriesId=5616), [R15](https://manta.net/en/series/o-tree-of-many-years?seriesId=5668)",
